{"_id":"68a7360d8ec3d8323af12913","nodeId":"tvk1Wh04BcFbAAwYWMx27","roadmapSlug":"blockchain","createdAt":"2025-08-21T15:06:53.730Z","description":"# Decentralized Storage\n\nDecentralized storage is where data is stored on a decentralized network across multiple locations by users or groups who are incentivized to join, store, and keep data accessible. The servers used are hosted by people, rather than a single company. Anyone is free to join, they are kept honest due to smart contracts, and they are incentivized to participate via tokens.","resources":[{"type":"article","title":"Decentralized Storage","url":"https://ethereum.org/en/developers/docs/storage/","_id":"6a7f4f5dcb44947debd1a32f"},{"type":"article","title":"What Is Decentralized Storage?","url":"https://medium.com/@ppio/what-is-decentralized-storage-9c4b761942e2","_id":"6a7f4f5dcb44947debd1a330"},{"type":"video","title":"Cyfrin Updraft | Introduction to IPFS","url":"https://updraft.cyfrin.io/courses/advanced-foundry/how-to-create-an-NFT-collection/what-is-ipfs","_id":"6a7f4f5dcb44947debd1a331"},{"type":"feed","title":"Explore top posts about Decentralized","url":"https://app.daily.dev/tags/decentralized?ref=roadmapsh","_id":"6a7f4f5dcb44947debd1a332"}],"updatedAt":"2026-08-14T17:24:45.750Z","lessonPacks":[],"paidResources":[],"contribution":"https://github.com/kamranahmedse/developer-roadmap/tree/master/roadmaps/blockchain/content/tvk1Wh04BcFbAAwYWMx27.md"}